      "id": "afc262d038234125ad0a5"
    },
    {
      "text": "### Static partition Prunning \n1. customerPartitionedDf is stored on hdfs with partitionby city\n2. when we filter spark will scan only specific city partition, avoid reading all the partitions ",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "ab29829589724e28a3b9a"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\n//lets partition it by listen date and release date to demonstrate dynaic partion pruning\nspotifyListeningActivityDf.selectExpr(\"activity_id\",\"song_id\",\"to_date(listen_date) as listen_date\", \"listen_duration\")\n.write.format(\"parquet\").mode(\"overwrite\").partitionBy(\"listen_date\").save(\"/FileStore/tables/suankiData/processed/spotify/parititonedSpotifyListeningActivityDf\")\n\nspotifySongDf.selectExpr(\"song_id\", \"title\", \"artist_id\",        \"to_date(release_date) as  release_date\")\n.write.format(\"parquet\").mode(\"overwrite\").partitionBy(\"release_date\").save(\"/FileStore/tables/suankiData/processed/spotify/partitionedSpotifySongDf\")\n\n\nval parititonedSpotifyListeningActivityDf = spark.read.parquet(\"/FileStore/tables/suankiData/processed/spotify/parititonedSpotifyListeningActivityDf\")\nval partitionedSpotifySongDf =  spark.read.parquet(\"/FileStore/tables/suankiData/processed/spotify/partitionedSpotifySongDf\")",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "26ef53250d5b483581328"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\njoinDF.explain",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
